@startuml admin-screen-flow
title RMS - Screen Flow: System Admin

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<Screen>> #E3F2FD
  BackgroundColor<<Popup>> #FFF3CD
  BackgroundColor<<External>> #E8EAF6
  BackgroundColor<<Error>> #FDE2E1
  BorderColor #1E3A5F
  FontColor #172033
}

state "Sign in\n/login" as Login <<Screen>>
state "Admin dashboard\n/admin" as Dashboard <<Screen>>
state "Approval queue\n/admin/approval-queue" as ApprovalQueue <<Screen>>
state "Request / plan details\nright drawer" as ApprovalDetail <<Popup>>
state "Approve / reject\nreview modal" as ReviewModal <<Popup>>
state "All recruitment requests\n/admin/requests" as Requests <<Screen>>
state "Request details\nmodal" as RequestDetail <<Popup>>
state "Interview results + final decisions\n/admin/interview-results" as Results <<Screen>>
state "Candidate profile / CV summary\nmodal" as CandidateSummary <<Popup>>
state "CV file preview\nnew browser tab" as CvPreview <<External>>
state "Request more information\nmodal" as RequestInfo <<Popup>>
state "Offer email / Hire\nmodal" as HireModal <<Popup>>
state "Rejection email\nmodal" as RejectModal <<Popup>>
state "User management\n/admin/users" as Users <<Screen>>
state "Create / edit user\nmodal" as UserEditor <<Popup>>
state "System settings\n/admin/settings" as Settings <<Screen>>
state "Add / edit department\nmodal" as DepartmentEditor <<Popup>>
state "Department requirements\nmodal" as RequirementsEditor <<Popup>>
state "Add pipeline stage\nmodal (draft until Save All)" as StageEditor <<Popup>>
state "Annual reports\n/admin/reports" as Reports <<Screen>>
state "Department statistics\n/admin/dept-stats" as DeptStats <<Screen>>
state "Unauthorized\n/unauthorized" as Unauthorized <<Error>>

[*] --> Login
Login --> Dashboard : Login succeeds (ADMIN)\n[POST /api/v1/auth/login]
Login --> Unauthorized : Signed-in user opens an ADMIN route\nwithout ADMIN role

Dashboard --> Dashboard : Load KPI and activity data\n[GET /api/v1/reports/admin-dashboard]
Dashboard --> ApprovalQueue : Sidebar / approval CTA
Dashboard --> Requests : Sidebar: All Requests
Dashboard --> Results : Sidebar: Interview Results
Dashboard --> Users : Sidebar: Users
Dashboard --> Settings : Sidebar: Settings
Dashboard --> Reports : Sidebar: Reports
Dashboard --> DeptStats : Sidebar: Department Statistics

ApprovalQueue --> ApprovalDetail : Open request or overall plan\n[GET /api/v1/recruitment-requests?limit=100]\n[GET /api/v1/departments]
ApprovalDetail --> ReviewModal : Approve or Reject
ReviewModal --> ApprovalQueue : Decide recruitment request\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id/decision]
ReviewModal --> ApprovalQueue : Approve / reject overall plan\n[PATCH /api/v1/overall-plan/:planId/approve|reject]
ApprovalDetail --> ApprovalQueue : Close drawer

Requests --> RequestDetail : Open request\n[GET /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id]
RequestDetail --> Requests : Close modal
Requests --> Requests : Assign selected requests to an HR manager\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id/assign]
Requests --> Requests : Export filtered / selected rows as client-side CSV
Requests --> Unauthorized : "New Request" currently navigates to\n/dept-head/create-request (role guard blocks ADMIN)

Results --> CandidateSummary : View candidate profile / CV summary\n[GET /api/v1/candidate-profiles/:candidateId]
Results --> Results : Load completed panels awaiting / holding a decision\n[GET /api/v1/admin/interview-results]
CandidateSummary --> CvPreview : Open latest CV file\n[GET /api/v1/candidate/cvs/candidate/:candidateId/latest/file]
CvPreview --> CandidateSummary : Close browser tab
CandidateSummary --> Results : Close modal
Results --> RequestInfo : Request more information
RequestInfo --> Results : Save HR follow-up request\n[POST /api/v1/admin/interview-results/:requestId/request-info]
Results --> HireModal : Hire / prepare offer email
HireModal --> Results : Approve hire, create offer and queue email\n[POST /api/v1/admin/interview-results/:requestId/decision]\n[decision=HIRE]
Results --> RejectModal : Reject / prepare rejection email
RejectModal --> Results : Mark Not Hired and queue email\n[POST /api/v1/admin/interview-results/:requestId/decision]\n[decision=REJECT]

Users --> UserEditor : Add or edit user
Users --> Users : Load users, organizations and departments\n[GET /api/v1/users?limit=100]\n[GET /api/v1/organizations]\n[GET /api/v1/departments]
UserEditor --> Users : Create user\n[POST /api/v1/users]
UserEditor --> Users : Update profile, role and/or status\n[PATCH /api/v1/users/:id]\n[PATCH /api/v1/users/:id/role|status]
Users --> Users : Quick activate / deactivate\n[PATCH /api/v1/users/:id/status]

Settings --> Settings : Save organization profile, approvals and pipeline\n[PATCH /api/v1/organizations/:organizationId]
Settings --> Settings : Load organization, departments and Department Heads\n[GET /api/v1/organizations]\n[GET /api/v1/departments]\n[GET /api/v1/users?role=DEPARTMENT_HEAD]
Settings --> DepartmentEditor : Add or edit department
DepartmentEditor --> Settings : Create / update department\n[POST /api/v1/departments]\n[PATCH /api/v1/departments/:id]
Settings --> Settings : Delete department\n[DELETE /api/v1/departments/:id]
Settings --> RequirementsEditor : Edit skills or bachelor requirements
RequirementsEditor --> Settings : Save department requirements\n[PATCH /api/v1/departments/:id]
Settings --> StageEditor : Add pipeline stage
StageEditor --> Settings : Add to local settings draft
Settings --> Settings : Discard reloads persisted configuration

Reports --> Reports : Select year and load report\n[GET /api/v1/reports/annual?year=:year]
Reports --> Reports : Export PDF directly\n[GET /api/v1/reports/annual/export?year=:year&format=pdf]
DeptStats --> DeptStats : Change range (30d / quarter / year)\n[GET /api/v1/reports/departments?range=:range]

Dashboard --> Login : Sign out\n[POST /api/v1/auth/logout]

note bottom of Dashboard
  Route aliases:
  /dashboard -> /admin for an ADMIN session
  /admin/dashboard -> /admin
  /admin/reports/annual -> /admin/reports
  /admin/reports/dept-stats -> /admin/dept-stats
end note

note bottom of Unauthorized
  ProtectedRoute sends unauthenticated access to /login
  and wrong-role access to /unauthorized.
end note

@enduml
